@startuml 使用案例 2_3_1: 收容所批次匯入
title 使用案例 2.3.1: 收容所批次匯入

actor "收容所會員" as User
participant "ShelterBatch.vue" as ShelterBatchPage
participant "shelters.ts" as ShelterAPI
participant "shelters.py(blueprint)" as ShelterBlueprint
participant "shelter_service.py" as ShelterService
participant "animal_tasks.py" as AnimalTasksWorker
participant "others.py(Job)(model)" as JobModel
participant "animal.py(model)" as AnimalModel
participant "medical_record.py(model)" as MedicalRecordModel
participant "others.py(Attachment)(model)" as AttachmentModel
participant "MinIO" as Storage
participant "Celery Worker" as CeleryWorker
database "MySQL" as DB

== 1. 檔案上傳與驗證 ==
User -> ShelterBatchPage: 選擇動物基本資訊 CSV (必填)
activate ShelterBatchPage
ShelterBatchPage -> ShelterBatchPage: 前端檔案格式驗證
note right
  檢查 CSV 格式
  必填欄位: animal_code, name, species, 
  breed, sex, dob, color, description
end note

User -> ShelterBatchPage: 選擇醫療記錄 CSV (選填)
ShelterBatchPage -> ShelterBatchPage: 驗證醫療記錄格式
note right
  必填欄位: animal_code, record_type,
  date, record_sequence
end note

User -> ShelterBatchPage: 上傳醫療證明文件 (選填)
note right
  檔名格式: {animal_code}_{record_sequence}.pdf
  例: 001_1.pdf, 001_2.pdf
end note

User -> ShelterBatchPage: 上傳動物照片 (選填)
note right
  檔名格式: {animal_code}_{order}.jpg
  例: 001_1.jpg, 001_2.jpg
end note

== 2. 提交批次匯入請求 ==
User -> ShelterBatchPage: 點擊「開始匯入」
ShelterBatchPage -> ShelterBatchPage: 建立 FormData
note right
  包含所有檔案:
  - animal_csv
  - medical_csv
  - medical_proofs[]
  - photos[]
end note

ShelterBatchPage -> ShelterAPI: batchImportAnimals(shelterId, formData)
activate ShelterAPI
ShelterAPI -> ShelterBlueprint: POST /shelters/{shelter_id}/animals/batch
activate ShelterBlueprint
ShelterBlueprint -> ShelterBlueprint: 檢查收容所權限
ShelterBlueprint -> ShelterBlueprint: 讀取 animal_csv 內容
ShelterBlueprint -> ShelterBlueprint: 讀取 medical_csv 內容 (如有)

== 3. 上傳檔案到 MinIO ==
loop 每個醫療證明文件
  ShelterBlueprint -> Storage: 上傳 PDF 證明
  activate Storage
  Storage --> ShelterBlueprint: 返回 storage_key 和 url
  deactivate Storage
  ShelterBlueprint -> ShelterBlueprint: 記錄 {filename, storage_key, url}
end

loop 每張動物照片
  ShelterBlueprint -> Storage: 上傳照片
  activate Storage
  Storage --> ShelterBlueprint: 返回 storage_key 和 url
  deactivate Storage
  ShelterBlueprint -> ShelterBlueprint: 記錄 {filename, storage_key, url}
end

== 4. 建立批次匯入任務 ==
ShelterBlueprint -> ShelterService: create_batch_import_job(...)
activate ShelterService
note right
  參數包含:
  - shelter_id
  - user_id
  - animal_csv_content
  - medical_csv_content
  - medical_proofs[] (MinIO 資訊)
  - photos[] (MinIO 資訊)
end note

ShelterService -> ShelterService: 檢查收容所存在
ShelterService -> ShelterService: 檢查使用者權限

ShelterService -> JobModel: 建立 Job 記錄
activate JobModel
JobModel -> DB: INSERT INTO jobs (type='IMPORT_ANIMALS', status='PENDING', payload={...})
activate DB
note right
  payload 包含:
  - shelter_id
  - animal_csv_content (CSV 文字內容)
  - medical_csv_content
  - medical_proofs[] (MinIO 路徑)
  - photos[] (MinIO 路徑)
end note
DB --> JobModel: job_id
deactivate DB
JobModel --> ShelterService: Job 物件
deactivate JobModel

ShelterService -> CeleryWorker: process_animal_batch_import.delay(job_id)
activate CeleryWorker
note right
  將任務加入 Celery 佇列
  返回 202 Accepted
end note
CeleryWorker --> ShelterService: Task ID
deactivate CeleryWorker

ShelterService --> ShelterBlueprint: Job 物件
deactivate ShelterService
ShelterBlueprint --> ShelterAPI: 202 Accepted + {job_id, message}
deactivate ShelterBlueprint
ShelterAPI --> ShelterBatchPage: {job_id}
deactivate ShelterAPI
ShelterBatchPage --> User: 顯示「批次匯入已加入隊列」
deactivate ShelterBatchPage

== 5. 背景任務處理 (Celery Worker) ==
CeleryWorker -> AnimalTasksWorker: process_animal_batch_import(job_id)
activate CeleryWorker
activate AnimalTasksWorker
AnimalTasksWorker -> JobModel: 查詢 Job
activate JobModel
JobModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM jobs WHERE job_id=?
activate DB
DB --> JobModel: Job 資料
deactivate DB
JobModel --> AnimalTasksWorker: Job 物件
deactivate JobModel

AnimalTasksWorker -> JobModel: 更新狀態為 RUNNING
activate JobModel
JobModel -> DB: UPDATE jobs SET status='RUNNING', started_at=now()
activate DB
deactivate DB
deactivate JobModel

AnimalTasksWorker -> AnimalTasksWorker: 從 payload 取得參數
AnimalTasksWorker -> AnimalTasksWorker: 解析 animal_csv_content

== 6. CSV 預驗證 ==
AnimalTasksWorker -> AnimalTasksWorker: 驗證 CSV 標題
note right
  檢查必填欄位:
  animal_code, name, species, breed,
  sex, dob, color, description
end note

AnimalTasksWorker -> AnimalTasksWorker: 預驗證照片檔名格式
note right
  檔名格式: {animal_code}_{order}.ext
  檢查 animal_code 是否在 CSV 中
  支援數字匹配 (001 vs 1)
end note

AnimalTasksWorker -> AnimalTasksWorker: 預驗證醫療證明檔名格式
note right
  檔名格式: {animal_code}_{record_sequence}.pdf
  檢查對應的醫療記錄是否存在
end note

alt 預驗證失敗
  AnimalTasksWorker -> JobModel: 更新狀態為 FAILED
  activate JobModel
  JobModel -> DB: UPDATE jobs SET status='FAILED', result_summary={errors}
  activate DB
  deactivate DB
  deactivate JobModel
  AnimalTasksWorker --> CeleryWorker: 返回錯誤統計
  deactivate AnimalTasksWorker
  deactivate CeleryWorker
else 預驗證通過
  
  == 7. 批次建立動物資料 ==
  loop 每一列動物資料
    AnimalTasksWorker -> AnimalTasksWorker: 解析動物資訊
    AnimalTasksWorker -> AnimalTasksWorker: 解析日期格式 (支援多種格式)
    
    AnimalTasksWorker -> AnimalModel: 建立 Animal 記錄
    activate AnimalModel
    AnimalModel -> DB: INSERT INTO animals (shelter_id, name, species, breed, sex, dob, status='DRAFT', ...)
    activate DB
    note right
      批次匯入動物預設為 DRAFT 狀態
      需後續在管理頁面批次提交或發布
      owner_id = NULL
      shelter_id = payload.shelter_id
    end note
    DB --> AnimalModel: animal_id
    deactivate DB
    AnimalModel --> AnimalTasksWorker: Animal 物件
    deactivate AnimalModel
    
    AnimalTasksWorker -> AnimalTasksWorker: 記錄映射 {animal_code: animal_id}
    AnimalTasksWorker -> AnimalTasksWorker: 記錄數字版本映射 (001→1)
  end
  
  == 8. 批次建立醫療記錄 ==
  alt 有 medical_csv_content
    loop 每一列醫療記錄
      AnimalTasksWorker -> AnimalTasksWorker: 根據 animal_code 查找 animal_id
      AnimalTasksWorker -> AnimalTasksWorker: 解析醫療記錄資訊
      
      AnimalTasksWorker -> MedicalRecordModel: 建立 MedicalRecord
      activate MedicalRecordModel
      MedicalRecordModel -> DB: INSERT INTO medical_records (animal_id, record_type, date, provider, details, ...)
      activate DB
      DB --> MedicalRecordModel: record_id
      deactivate DB
      MedicalRecordModel --> AnimalTasksWorker: MedicalRecord 物件
      deactivate MedicalRecordModel
      
      AnimalTasksWorker -> AnimalTasksWorker: 記錄映射 {animal_code}_{record_sequence}: record_id}
    end
  end
  
  == 9. 關聯醫療證明文件 ==
  alt 有 medical_proofs
    loop 每個醫療證明文件
      AnimalTasksWorker -> AnimalTasksWorker: 解析檔名 {animal_code}_{record_sequence}.pdf
      AnimalTasksWorker -> AnimalTasksWorker: 查找對應的 medical_record_id
      
      alt 找到對應醫療記錄
        AnimalTasksWorker -> AttachmentModel: 建立 Attachment (關聯到 medical_record)
        activate AttachmentModel
        AttachmentModel -> DB: INSERT INTO attachments (owner_type='medical_record', owner_id=record_id, storage_key, url, ...)
        activate DB
        note right
          優先關聯到醫療記錄
        end note
        DB --> AttachmentModel: attachment_id
        deactivate DB
        AttachmentModel --> AnimalTasksWorker: Attachment 物件
        deactivate AttachmentModel
      else 找不到醫療記錄
        AnimalTasksWorker -> AttachmentModel: 建立 Attachment (關聯到 animal)
        activate AttachmentModel
        AttachmentModel -> DB: INSERT INTO attachments (owner_type='animal', owner_id=animal_id, storage_key, url, ...)
        activate DB
        note right
          回退機制: 直接關聯到動物
          保留檔案不遺失
        end note
        DB --> AttachmentModel: attachment_id
        deactivate DB
        AttachmentModel --> AnimalTasksWorker: Attachment 物件
        deactivate AttachmentModel
      end
    end
  end
  
  == 10. 關聯動物照片 ==
  alt 有 photos
    loop 每張照片
      AnimalTasksWorker -> AnimalTasksWorker: 解析檔名 {animal_code}_{order}.jpg
      AnimalTasksWorker -> AnimalTasksWorker: 查找對應的 animal_id (支援數字匹配)
      note right
        支援多種 animal_code 格式:
        - 原始匹配: "001" → "001"
        - 數字匹配: "1" → "001"
        - 零填充匹配: "01" → "001"
      end note
      
      AnimalTasksWorker -> AnimalModel: 建立 AnimalImage 記錄
      activate AnimalModel
      AnimalModel -> DB: INSERT INTO animal_images (animal_id, url, storage_key, order, ...)
      activate DB
      note right
        使用專用 AnimalImage 模型
        不是 Attachment 模型
        order: 照片顯示順序 (從檔名解析)
      end note
      DB --> AnimalModel: image_id
      deactivate DB
      AnimalModel --> AnimalTasksWorker: AnimalImage 物件
      deactivate AnimalModel
    end
  end
  
  == 11. 完成任務 ==
  AnimalTasksWorker -> AnimalTasksWorker: 計算統計資訊與判斷任務狀態
  note right
    判斷邏輯:
    1. 動物匯入失敗 → status='FAILED'
    2. 所有附件失敗 → status='FAILED' + overall_result='partial_failed'
    3. 部分附件失敗 → status='SUCCEEDED' + overall_result='partial_success'
    4. 完全成功 → status='SUCCEEDED' + overall_result='success'
    
    統計結構:
    - overall_result: 'success' | 'partial_success' | 'partial_failed' | 'failed'
    - result_message: 中文結果描述
    - has_errors: boolean
    - animals: {total, success, failed}
    - medical_records: {total, success}
    - medical_proofs: {total, success}
    - photos: {total, success}
    - error_samples: errors[:20] (前20個錯誤)
  end note
  
  AnimalTasksWorker -> JobModel: 更新狀態為 SUCCEEDED 或 FAILED
  activate JobModel
  JobModel -> DB: UPDATE jobs SET status=?, completed_at=now(), result_summary={...}
  activate DB
  deactivate DB
  deactivate JobModel
  AnimalTasksWorker --> CeleryWorker: 返回統計結果
  deactivate AnimalTasksWorker
  deactivate CeleryWorker
end

== 12. 使用者查看結果 ==
User -> ShelterBatchPage: 查看批次匯入任務狀態
activate ShelterBatchPage
ShelterBatchPage -> ShelterAPI: getJobs()
activate ShelterAPI
ShelterAPI -> ShelterBlueprint: GET /shelters/{shelter_id}/jobs
activate ShelterBlueprint
ShelterBlueprint -> JobModel: 查詢 Jobs
activate JobModel
JobModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM jobs WHERE payload->>'shelter_id' = ?
activate DB
DB --> JobModel: Jobs 列表
deactivate DB
JobModel --> ShelterBlueprint: Jobs
deactivate JobModel
ShelterBlueprint --> ShelterAPI: Jobs 列表
deactivate ShelterBlueprint
ShelterAPI --> ShelterBatchPage: Jobs 資料
deactivate ShelterAPI
ShelterBatchPage --> User: 顯示任務狀態和結果統計

alt 任務成功
  ShelterBatchPage -> ShelterBatchPage: 自動跳轉到收容所動物管理頁面
  ShelterBatchPage --> User: 顯示成功訊息
else 任務失敗
  ShelterBatchPage --> User: 顯示錯誤清單和修正建議
end
deactivate ShelterBatchPage

@enduml